<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY SEPT NET FOREIGN DEBT $13.2 BLN - CEN.BANK.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY SEPT NET FOREIGN DEBT $13.2 BLN - CEN.BANK.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's net foreign debt</p>
<p>stood at $13.2 billion in September, down from $13.8 billion in</p>
<p>August, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said in a statement</p>
<p>on Friday.</p>
</text>
